Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.06,0:00:35.84,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, it's a thunderbolt of a backhand from Sun.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N孙心然这一拍反手 如同雷霆
