Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.18,0:00:53.58,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, I think she's just found a line.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一球 看起来刚好压线
