Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.16,0:01:10.46,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, there were question marks about fitness coming into this one after the injury.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N赛前 伤病后的体能曾让人担忧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.27,0:01:13.61,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} 首盘收好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.61,0:01:15.64,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}第二盘没有那么快分出高下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.64,0:01:18.28,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}双方一路守到后半盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.27,0:01:22.55,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}次盘{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} 自己的发球局必须守住
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.55,0:01:24.72,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}孙心然把球送向对手两侧
