Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.38,0:01:42.30,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Just found the line again.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N又一次 刚好压线
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.57,0:01:44.88,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}真正的险关在{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.88,0:01:46.09,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}自己的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.09,0:01:48.04,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}刘婧文一次次拿到盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.04,0:01:50.49,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}她必须一分一分救回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.57,0:01:55.38,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}两个盘点 先救这一分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.54,0:02:00.54,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, what a chance! Will she get a better one?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N多好的机会 还会有更好的机会吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.92,0:02:11.32,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, it lands in.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一球 落在界内
