Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.40,0:02:28.72,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Still can't get it done.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N还是没能拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.36,0:02:34.92,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Another set point saved.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N又救回一个盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.40,0:02:41.20,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Drops just wide.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N落点 稍稍出了边线
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.66,0:02:57.46,TL,,0,0,306,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, my!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N太惊人了
